          "_name": "header11",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header11\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <a href=\"https://maxwebleads.com/13436/3054/2/?   \"><img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/lungora-hero.webp\" alt=\"Lungora\" title=\"Ikaria Lean Belly Juice\"></a><br>\n               \n                \n                <h2 class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><center></center></h2>\n\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper text-center\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><div><b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">Lungora</b><br></div></h2>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Lungora is a daily dietary supplement formulated to help maintain lung health and support respiration, breathing and well-being. It has been developed for adults who would like to incorporate a daily respiration supplement into their lives without interrupting their active lifestyle.<br><br><div>Lungora is a well-blended formula that includes such ingredients as Magnesium Glycinate, Alpha-Lipoic Acid, Butcher’s Broom Root Extract, L-Carnitine, Turmeric Extract (95% curcuminoids), and Coenzyme Q10. The combination will be beneficial in providing you with all-round support for your respiratory health, antioxidant effects, circulation, energy production, and nerve function.</div><br><div>With 30 capsules in each bottle and one capsule recommended daily, Lungora is easy to integrate into your daily schedule. The complete formula of Lungora is made specifically for those adults who want an easy way to support their lung health and overall well-being on a daily basis.</div></h2>\n                        \n                       <hr> \n                        <h2 class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">REGULAR PRICE:  $179/per Bottle</h2>\n                       \n            \n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Today Only for: $49/per Bottle</b></p>  \n                        \n                        \n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://maxwebleads.com/13436/3054/2/?   \" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-cart-add mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>GET A DISCOUNT</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
