          "_name": "features11",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features11\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <!---->\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"2\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitleCard\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentCard\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#fafafa\" condition=\"!transparentCard\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#bed3f9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid' : fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"title\">\n            <h3 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                <b>Product List</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h4 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                Subtitle\n            </h4>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/lungora-reviews-3.webp\" alt=\"Robert T. - Denver, CO\" title>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"top-line\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCard\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>“I wanted something for everyday support”\n</b><div><b>🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟</b><br><b>&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">Verified Purchase</b><b style=\"font-size: 2rem;\"><br></b></div></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".cost\">\n                                            $39</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">A quick solution was not what I wanted. I wanted something that I can include in my usual wellness regimen. Lungora appeared to be a good fit and I thought that I should give it a try. I must say that I have been enjoying its simplicity a lot. It gives me a good feeling to know that I am focusing on my respiratory wellness.<br><b>Robert T. - Denver, CO</b><br>\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/lungora-reviews-1.webp\" alt=\"Linda M. - Phoenix, AZ\" title>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"top-line\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCard\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>“My morning routine feels much easier now”</b><div><b>🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟\n</b><div><b>&nbsp;Verified Purchase</b></div></div></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".cost\">\n                                            $49</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">It was always difficult for me to stick to supplements since I did not want something elaborate. However, I decided to give Lungora a go due to the fact that it is easy to incorporate into your everyday life. Taking the supplement in the morning, I never miss it now. The best thing about it is that it does not become a burden.<br><b>Linda M. - Phoenix, AZ</b><br>\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image mb-4 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/lungora-reviews-2.webp\" alt=\"James R. - Austin, TX\" title>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"top-line\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCard\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>“I’m finally being more consistent with my respiratory\n</b><div><b>wellness”</b></div><div><b>🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟\n</b><div><b>&nbsp;Verified Purchase</b></div></div></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".cost\">\n                                            $49</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Recently, I have become more concerned about my general wellbeing as I get older, and I was looking for something that would be easy to include into my daily life without having to overhaul all my habits. Lungora has been really easy to keep up with since it only takes one capsule per day. Since using it, I have a feeling that I am now being proactive with my respiratory wellbeing, and that’s already boosted my confidence.<br><b>James R. - Austin, TX</b><br>\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
